      "description": "The informal network of relocated AI researchers, previously focused on safety and evaluation, begins coordinating open, adversarial testing of high-capability models across multiple academic hubs in the EU. This decentralized effort produces a shared red-teaming protocol that gains traction among non-US-aligned institutions globally, positioning the EU as an alternative pole for trustworthy evaluation despite its weak sovereignty.",
